#
# macOS (ld64) equivalent of seerodbc.map. -exported_symbols_list makes the
# driver export ONLY the ODBC entry points; every other symbol (protocol core,
# OpenSSL, libc helpers) is hidden from the Driver Manager and the host process.
# Mach-O prefixes C symbols with an underscore, so the pattern is _SQL*.
#
# macOS links two-level namespace by default, which binds a *W wrapper's call to
# an ANSI SQL* function to OUR definition rather than the Driver Manager's - the
# same guarantee -Wl,-Bsymbolic gives us with GNU ld, so no extra flag is needed.
_SQL*
